            "pages": {
              "end": 13,
              "start": 13
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The district court entered an order directing the State to transport Twyford to a medical facility to aid its adjudication of his habeas petition."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "8efa05321ad41a05288b326714ba62acb7f259b789a5e70335653034f69d9ad2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-8efa05321ad4-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court granted review to decide whether and under what circumstances a federal district court may order a State to transport a prisoner to a hospital for testing."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "14614e2953d714489a1e377430903a4d6885661cc39ce1096ff60c869f32eb71",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-14614e2953d7-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "In certain rare circumstances, a federal court may order a state prisoner transported under the All Writs Act."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background & Question",
    "status": "complete",
