            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch dissented, stating he would not reach the merits of the petition."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "8efa05321ad41a05288b326714ba62acb7f259b789a5e70335653034f69d9ad2",
